{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/bef3a7502219d35cf17732cb7fc75c48.avif?t=1765254097\" width=733 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/97f0b62285c425c3c972f2fee69466e2.webp?t=1765254097\" width=513 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A challenging first-person survival horror game with no combat, no safety, and endless disorientation. Betrayed and sent to a dangerous world, your chance of survival is based on your spells and how you utilize them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/65027db644993db446890c854bfe4366.webp?t=1765254097\" width=419 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a hostile, fog-filled world and try to escape the torment.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rely on three spells - lucent, descry, and ward. Each with their own cost and risk.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and activate the six hidden sigils to awaken the Tree of Life.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the hunt in a world designed to keep you forever.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric and challenging survival horror with no combat - only endurance.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/7997e48d7a58b23d42bfd45b94556e12.webp?t=1765254097\" width=160 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forced to rely on your limited spells, with endless fleeting moments of safety, find and activate all six sigils scattered around the map to escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/9b639ad413c1ad84d710f0ada460e255.webp?t=1765254097\" width=211 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alone, unarmed, and hunted by the world, you can only use three spells; each limited and costly.</strong>\u00a0<strong>Each cast may guide you closer to escape, or beckon the dread to you. Only by strategically using your spells and activating the sigils  can you break free. Sacrifice is inevitable.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucent \u2013 Used as your primary light source and to charge the sigils; can also be turned into a projectile.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descry \u2013 Used to scan the environment and allows you to find the sigil markers.\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ward \u2013 A shield that does what shields do. Has duration and durability.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/ce0270eac59f02f2714947df37a6f33e.webp?t=1765254097\" width=729 height=24 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810130?t=1765254097","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810130?t=1765254097","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/87ef9712fc9feb550995e39c23873b8fee6e659c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765254097","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/87ef9712fc9feb550995e39c23873b8fee6e659c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765254097","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4015670,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/bef3a7502219d35cf17732cb7fc75c48.avif?t=1765254097\" width=733 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/97f0b62285c425c3c972f2fee69466e2.webp?t=1765254097\" width=513 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p cl